    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553">

                <pb facs="0611" n="507" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg507"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 822.124/283.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Minister
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-06-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 26, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Americans should not be excluded from work of sanitation, especially after
                    Ecuador invited the Isthmian Canal Commission to make report on the work which
                    Colonel Gorgas made. Use your best efforts to secure for Americans opportunity
                    to obtain contract. Give names of American firms bidding.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
